title: Rina Deshi
from: Rina Deshi
gist: Rina heard about the transfer. She told you to sleep on it, then beat you at Tiles to help you think.
== lines
rina: So. Headquarters. Pell's been sighing at the Tiles board for an hour. It's very annoying.   [sigh]
rina > you: My advice is medical. Sleep on it. Twice. Eat something. Then decide.
rina: My sister took a station post at your age. She hated it a month. Then she loved it. We still argue about it.
? choice
* Did she ever wish she'd stayed?   flavour:listen
  rina: Every Tuesday. She says that's how you know it was a real choice.   [nod]
* Play me at Tiles. I need to think.   flavour:cheer
  rina: Good idea. I'll win. You'll think. Everyone's happy.   [laugh]
rina: Whatever you choose, I'm still undefeated. You'll have to come back to fix that.
